             half of your money.  If you win you get half their money.
             The rest of the rules pertaining to combat are the same from
             The Arena.

    REST IN A HOTEL:
             The hotel is where you can rest and regain your hitpoints.
             The higher your rank the more money it takes to stay a night.
             Each night you stay returns 30 hitpoints back to you.  At the
             hotel prompt you would type in how many nights you want to
             stay, if you type in how many hitpoints you want to drop, it
             will stay that many nights, the results of that could be
             disasterous for your bank account. :-)  Also a small fee will
             be deducted for room service.

    LIST YOUR STATS:
             This option lists your stats, money, rank, weapon, vehicle,
             etc...  Not much else.

